{%- comment -%}
  Clean card image (11 Nov): a background-free, evenly sized pack shot for the storefront only (cards, compare, menu,
  search). The Shopify product images keep the SNH frame (Google Shopping / listings); these clean copies live in the
  theme as assets/pc-<handle>.webp and are listed in snippets/snh-clean-list as ",handle:main-image-file,".
  The file name is part of the key, so if a product's main image is changed in admin the card falls back to it
  automatically until the clean copy is regenerated (docs/clean-images/README.md). Outputs the asset URL or nothing.
  product
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign ci_out = ''
  assign ci_fi = product.featured_media.preview_image | default: product.featured_image
  comment
    bundles keep the thumbnail the team uploads (11 Nov), so no clean copy for them
  endcomment
  assign ci_pt = product.type | downcase
  if ci_pt contains 'bundle'
    assign ci_fi = nil
  endif
  if ci_fi
    assign ci_base = ci_fi.src | split: '?' | first | split: '/' | last
    assign ci_key = ',' | append: product.handle | append: ':' | append: ci_base | append: ','
    capture ci_list
      render 'snh-clean-list'
    endcapture
    if ci_list contains ci_key
      assign ci_out = 'pc-' | append: product.handle | append: '.webp' | asset_url
    endif
  endif
-%}{{ ci_out }}
